        "rating": 4,
        "relative_time_description": "3 months ago",
        "text": "Staff are very nice and are very helpfull . My daughter went for an eye exam and needed glass, the sales were great she got two pairs.\nI find it crazy expensive for adults for eye exams though. 180$ an exam. Shame they aren't cheaper. The insurance companies only cover like 100$ at 80%. I know its not the optomitrists fault. Just sucks. We get all our glasses here. Cant wait to get  my daughters glasses.",
        "time": 1761874873,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Kendra Mathieu",
