        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "10 months ago",
        "text": "Great staff loves the place not they are affordable glasses and you can even get opinions from the star memebers on the glasses of they are not occupied with another client great service can’t wait to receive m’y new glasses",
        "time": 1744764313,
